\section{Labs}
\begin{itemize}
  \item All ECE474 labs build on each other to create a software prototype.
%   \item This year by the end of the quarter you will create the software for a
% heart assist device: ``Left Ventricular Assist Device" (LVAD).
%   \item The system will simulate actual operation as closely as possible.
%   \item We will implement features such as pulse generation, pulse frequency measurement, closed-loop motor speed control, and network communication.
  \item We will implement more and more tasks, building the complexity and 
  efficiency of the real-time code. 
  \item We will squeeze more and more performance out of the ATMega2560 chip 
  by adding tasks as the quarter goes on.
  \item We will continue to maintain hard real time performance.
\end{itemize}

